# GitHub Linguist — keep the repository's language stats focused on the
# application code (Python), not the large analysis/training notebooks. Their
# embedded plot/output cells are ~8x the size of the source and would otherwise
# report the project as ~97% "Jupyter Notebook" (and the HTML from their output
# cells). The notebooks stay in the repo and remain browsable; they're just not
# counted as the primary language.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation

# Labelled eval fixtures are data, not code.
eval/cases/*.jsonl linguist-data
